questions.statement:
What does the following Java code print?

```java
String a = new String("AAPL");
String b = new String("AAPL");
System.out.println((a == b) + " " + a.equals(b));
```

Given the classes below, what does `new LimitOrder().label()` return?

```java
class Order {
  String tag() { return "ORDER"; }
  String label() { return "[" + tag() + "]"; }
}
class LimitOrder extends Order {
  String tag() { return "LIMIT"; }
}
```

